### Create TCS daily market data
POST http://localhost:8082/api/market-data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "TCS",
  "tradingDate": "2026-10-12",
  "openPrice": 3200.00,
  "highPrice": 3250.00,
  "lowPrice": 3180.00,
  "closePrice": 3230.00,
  "volume": 1500000
}

### Get latest TCS candle
GET http://localhost:8082/api/market-data/TCS/latest


### Get TCS history
GET http://localhost:8082/api/market-data/TCS/history?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### Unknown symbol
GET http://localhost:8082/api/market-data/UNKNOWN/latest


### Invalid price
POST http://localhost:8082/api/market-data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "INFY",
  "tradingDate": "2026-10-12",
  "openPrice": -100,
  "highPrice": 110,
  "lowPrice": 90,
  "closePrice": 105,
  "volume": 1000
}

### Invalid date range
GET http://localhost:8082/api/market-data/TCS/history?from=2026-10-31&to=2026-10-01